{"articleNo":"355148","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=355148&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] 제주 탐라도서관 '제주북페어 2022 책운동회' 개최 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.03.21","hit":"25963","attachments":[{"name":"제주북페어2022_리플릿.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=355148&attachNo=110425"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmwehBmCBMCaBTAUgSwDYEcBGOBeAIgOoCCAyoQgEoAeA0gDIB0AVgA4DmQA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><br></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">탐라도서관은 오는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">4. 9. ~ 10. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">양일간 전국 독립출판물 제작자와 소규모 출판사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">독립책방 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">200</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">팀이 참여하는 독립출판물 박람회 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">제주북페어 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2022&gt;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">를 개최하오니 많은 관심과 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">행 사 명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: &lt;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">제주북페어 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2022 </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">책운동회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&gt;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">기    간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 2022. 4. 9.(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) ~ 10.(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) 11:00 ~ 18:00</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">장    소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">제주시 한라체육관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">제주시 서광로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">길 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">24)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">참 가 팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">전국 독립출판물 제작자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">소규모 출판사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">독립책방 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">200</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">팀</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">내    용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">제작자 도서 전시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">판매</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">관련 세미나 및 전시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">체험 프로그램 운영</span></p><p></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"9488\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"9, 1, 1, 5656\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_Unknown_Version\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"User\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"